{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeps a list of the entities that match a query’s structure, so that queries and updates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the same conditions visit only those entities."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Speeding-Up-Queries","generated":true,"title":"Speeding Up Queries","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/group(_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/group(checked:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/index(_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/lookup(_:)"]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/cache(_:)"]}],"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"fileName":"QueryCache.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/QueryCache.swift#L127"},"externalID":"s:11WorldModule0A0V5cacheyyAA5QueryVyxxQp_QPGRvzAA0D4TermRzlF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"WorldModule","title":"cache(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cache","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Query","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule5QueryV"},{"text":"<repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">)","kind":"text"}]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/cache(_:)"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cache","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"query","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule5QueryV","text":"Query","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query"},{"text":"<repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9QueryTermP","text":"QueryTerm","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The query whose matching entities to keep.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"query"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A query normally walks the storage of one of its types and checks every entity there"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"against the rest of its conditions. When few of those entities match, most of that walk is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wasted. A cached query keeps the matching entities in a list of their own, kept current as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you spawn, insert, remove and despawn, so a visit can walk that list instead."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use a cache for a query you run often whose conditions exclude most of the entities it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"would otherwise walk, such as the few entities that are awake among many asleep:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["struct Asleep: Component {}"]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var world = World()","let awake = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0))","let sleeper = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0), Asleep())","","world.cache(Query(Position.self, Velocity.self).without(Asleep.self))","","world.update(Position.self, reading: Velocity.self, where: .without(Asleep.self)) { position, row in","    position.x += row.components.dx","}","print(world[Position.self, of: awake].x, world[Position.self, of: sleeper].x)","\/\/ Prints \"1.0 0.0\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The cache holds the entities that hold every component term of "},{"code":"query","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and every type its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"filter requires, hold none of the types it excludes or skips by default (such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Disabled"},{"type":"text","text":"), and pass its groups of alternatives that name no change ticks. A query or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"update uses the cache when its own conditions imply the cache’s: it requires every type the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cache requires, excludes every type the cache excludes, and has the same groups of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"alternatives. It walks the cache only when the cache is smaller than the storage it would"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"otherwise walk. A cache never changes which entities a visit finds, only how it finds them."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf"},{"type":"text","text":" terms, change-tick filters and relation filters don’t narrow the cache; a visit"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still checks them for each cached entity. Caching the same conditions twice keeps one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cache. A copy of the world keeps its caches; a snapshot doesn’t."}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Complexity","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":"·","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"t"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") for ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" entities in the smallest required type, or every live","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entity when the query requires none, and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"t"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" conditions. Each cache adds O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"t"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") to adding","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or removing a component of a type it names.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/index(_:)":{"title":"index(_:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"index","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type)"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/index(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/index(_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeps a map from each value of a component type to the entities holding it, so that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/lookup(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" finds them without walking the type’s storage."}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/group(checked:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Keeps the given component types packed in the same order, throwing an error if they can’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be grouped.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/group(checked:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/group(checked:)","type":"topic","title":"group(checked:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"group"},{"kind":"text","text":"<each "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"checked"},{"kind":"text","text":": repeat (each "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":").Type) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule10GroupErrorO","text":"GroupError"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/cache(_:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeps a list of the entities that match a query’s structure, so that queries and updates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the same conditions visit only those entities."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/cache(_:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/cache(_:)","type":"topic","title":"cache(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cache","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule5QueryV","text":"Query"},{"kind":"text","text":"<repe